description	"Obi-Wan Kenobi 

A Jedi with exceptional defenses. Choose between the resourcefulness of a Master or the raw agility of a Padawan.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Cyan/Blue)
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (3)
--- BP Regen: 5/.4s to 100
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- 8% more Fast style Dmg
-- 125% Spec Dmg mult
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more Dmg
 
^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Push (3)
- Pull (1)
- Sense (3)
- Protect (1)
- Mindtrick (3)

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armor
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Force Block (1)
- Force Focus (2)"
